<title>UK: MSCI to launch Russia index on December 1.</title>
<headline>MSCI to launch Russia index on December 1.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley Capital International is to launch a standalone Russia share index on December 1.</p>
<p>&quot;Initially it will be a stand-alone index. Its potential inclusion in MSCI Emerging Markets Free (EMF) will be considered at a later date,&quot; MSCI said in a statement.</p>
<p>The MSCI indices are used by fund managers to allocate assets and track performance and inclusion in the EMF index could increase money flows to Russia as investors using that index as a benchmark would allocate assets there in order to mimic MSCI's geographic spread. -- David Chance London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
